    <scopecontent encodinganalog="3.3.1">
      <p>The collection contains both media guides and programs regarding the Track and Field teams at varying dates between 1951 and 2009. They include both men's and women's statistics and records for each year. The media guides provide individual and team statistics for each season, as well as the records held from previous years. Also, these include point totals from the Conference meets dating back to 1915. However, the programs include specific information relevant to an individual meet. This ranges from the schedule, the competitions' statistics, and Texas A&amp;M's roster.</p>
    </scopecontent>
    <arrangement encodinganalog="3.3.4">
